    "commit": "9d0831fdf",
    "summary": "Implemented S2 explicit recovery/failure contracts, durable per-unit reservations and retry/action history, unfinished-only resume and user-approved fresh restart, initial-plus-three technical retries with directed one-launch recovery, subject-only monitoring/late-output fences, active-tool-aware inactivity and normal main-owned MCP/IPC integration. Production build and 100 focused regressions pass. Compiled synthetic qualification passed baseline three-call smoke and three recovery scenarios (17 fake CLI calls), including actual disposable owner-process termination/restart, retry exhaustion/user direction and tool-time mutation/full restart. No hosted design-review smoke was required for qualification; S2 LLD approval retains the explicit user override for its technically incomplete independent review. Selective impact and permanent lifecycle/history publication remain S3/S4. Evidence: /tmp/design-review-s2-verification.json."
